.changeset/transactional-mutation-completion.md --- Text
 1 ---
 2 "@convex-dev/workpool": minor
 3 ---
 4 
 5 Add `completeTransactionally` to mutation enqueue options so successful work,
 6 its non-excluded `onComplete` callback, and completion bookkeeping commit
 7 together. If the callback or bookkeeping fails, the transaction rolls back and
 8 periodic recovery reports the work as failed. The default completion behavior is
 9 unchanged.
