.changeset/transactional-query-completion.md --- Text
 1 ---
 2 "@convex-dev/workpool": minor
 3 ---
 4 
 5 Support `completeTransactionally` for queued queries so their non-excluded
 6 success callback and completion bookkeeping commit together. Query reads use an
 7 independent snapshot and may be stale when the callback commits; read data that
 8 must still be current within the callback. Run ordinary queued queries through
 9 the action batch worker with independent snapshots.
10 

